--- objects
  /b: must be integer, not string
  /: must have at least 1 key
  /: must have at most 1 key
  /a~1b/c~0d: must be string, not integer
--- arrays
  /2: repeats item 0
  /1: repeats item 0
  /1: repeats item 0
  /: must have at least 1 item
--- $ref and boolean schemas
  /children/1/value: must be integer, not string
  /children/1/children/0: the key "value" is required
ok
